Double a negative floor prediction deviation using defined signed arithmetic.
Floor values and predictions are bounded by the quantizer (at most256),
so multiplication by two retains the intended representable folded code.

--- a/thirdparty/libvorbis/floor1.c
+++ b/thirdparty/libvorbis/floor1.c
@@ -819,3 +819,3 @@
           else
-            val=-1-(val<<1);
+            val=-1-val*2;
         else
